<p>Today's brief covers stories from 17 to 18 November.</p>

<figure class="dgm">
<div class="dgm-stack">
<div class="dgm-tier"><small>Runtime</small><div class="dgm-nodes"><span class="hl">Java4Shell<em>OpenJDK, every Java server</em></span></div></div>
<div class="dgm-tier"><small>Dependencies and CI</small><div class="dgm-nodes"><span class="hl">agent-framework on PyPI<em>cloud and CI secrets</em></span></div></div>
<div class="dgm-tier"><small>Models</small><div class="dgm-nodes"><span>GPT-6.2 Astra and Sol<em>ChatGPT, Codex and API</em></span></div></div>
<div class="dgm-tier"><small>Infrastructure</small><div class="dgm-nodes"><span>Malaysia data centres<em>approved pipeline, policy on jobs</em></span></div></div>
